#X text 1000 2010 The counter wraps after the last step: the Lua's last <n> \, which it answers on the page outlet for g_grid \, also sets mod's right inlet. Knob 2 sends it (u_map's last-step) \, for every track at once \, and the steps past it keep their notes., f 58;
